#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:2
msgid "Three-Mode Solvation Comparison"
msgstr "三模式溶剂化比较"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:4
msgid ""
"Compare ``fixed``, ``hf_corrected``, and ``dynamic`` solvation modes. Run :doc:`h2-mc-solvation` "
"first. This comparison includes the more expensive dynamic circuit."
msgstr "比较 ``fixed``、``hf_corrected`` 和 ``dynamic`` 溶剂化模式。先运行 :doc:`h2-mc-solvation`。本比较包含成本较高的动态电路。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:8
msgid "Run The Script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:15
msgid "Modes"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:20
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:21
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "公式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:22
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:23
msgid "``fixed``"
msgstr "``fixed``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:24
msgid "``E_QPE(H_vac) + E_MM``"
msgstr "``E_QPE(H_vac) + E_MM``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:25
msgid "Fast baseline that ignores solvent changes in correlation"
msgstr "忽略溶剂引起的电子相关变化的快速基线"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:26
msgid "``hf_corrected``"
msgstr "``hf_corrected``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:27
msgid "``E_HF(R) + E_MM``"
msgstr "``E_HF(R) + E_MM``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:28
msgid "HF-level MM embedding with interval QPE diagnostics"
msgstr "HF 层级的 MM 嵌入，并按间隔执行 QPE 诊断"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:29
msgid "``dynamic``"
msgstr "``dynamic``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:30
msgid "``E_QPE(H_eff) + E_MM``"
msgstr "``E_QPE(H_eff) + E_MM``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:31
msgid "Runtime MM-embedded QPE coefficients"
msgstr "运行时 MM 嵌入 QPE 系数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:33
msgid "The comparison delegates analysis to ``q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison()``."
msgstr "比较通过 ``q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison()`` 执行分析。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:36
msgid "Compile-Once Idea"
msgstr "编译一次的思路"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:57
msgid ""
"Dynamic mode uses Hamiltonian coefficients that Catalyst can trace at runtime. Catalyst compiles "
"the circuit structure once. The coefficients change across MC steps."
msgstr "Dynamic 模式使用 Catalyst 可在运行时追踪的哈密顿量系数。Catalyst 编译一次电路结构，系数在 MC 步骤间变化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:61
msgid "Reading The Result"
msgstr "解读结果"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:63
msgid ""
"The key scientific quantity is ``delta_corr-pol``, the correlation-polarization coupling term. "
"For small H2 runs, it measures whether QPE energy changes materially when MM embedding changes "
"the Hamiltonian as well as the classical correction."
msgstr "关键科学量是电子相关与极化耦合项 ``delta_corr-pol``。对于小规模 H2 运行，它衡量当 MM 嵌入不仅改变经典校正，还改变哈密顿量时，QPE 能量是否有实质变化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:68
msgid "Optional H3O+ Diagnostics"
msgstr "可选 H3O+ 诊断"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.rst:70
msgid ""
"H3O+ workflows use a larger active space and many more Hamiltonian terms. The public H3O+ scripts"
" are useful for ionic-solvation diagnostics, but they are not the default tutorial path. Use a 16"
" GB+ RAM machine for ``h3o_mc_solvation.py`` and a 30 GB+ RAM machine for 8-bit or dynamic "
"Trotter diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"H3O+ 工作流使用更大的活性空间及更多哈密顿量项。公开 H3O+ 脚本可用于离子溶剂化诊断，但不是默认教程路径。运行 ``h3o_mc_solvation.py`` 时使用至少 16 GB "
"内存的机器；8 位或动态 Trotter 诊断使用至少 30 GB 内存的机器。"
